WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:18.000
Toad looked up from the bench.

2
00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:21.273
"Are you all right?" said the train engineer.

3
00:00:21.274 --> 00:00:23.737
"You don't look very happy."

4
00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:27.461
"Oh, sir!" said Toad, crying.

5
00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:31.105
"I am a poor washwoman.

6
00:00:31.106 --> 00:00:34.134
I lost all my money."

7
00:00:34.135 --> 00:00:37.467
"That's awful," said the engineer.

8
00:00:37.468 --> 00:00:42.274
"I can't pay for a ticket," cried Toad.

9
00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:44.842
"I must get home!"

10
00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:48.472
"Do you have kids?" asked the engineer.

11
00:00:48.473 --> 00:00:52.043
"Why, yes!" said Toad.

12
00:00:52.044 --> 00:00:55.250
"I have lots of kids.

13
00:00:55.251 --> 00:00:59.070
They will be crying and hungry."

14
00:00:59.071 --> 00:01:02.686
"Well, I'll help you," said the engineer.

15
00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:05.760
"You can wash my shirts to repay me."

16
00:01:05.761 --> 00:01:14.469
"I will, as soon as I get home," said Toad.

17
00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.285
"Hop up!" said the engineer.

18
00:01:17.286 --> 00:01:19.872
"You can ride on the engine with me."

19
00:01:19.873 --> 00:01:23.272
Toad thanked him and climbed up.

20
00:01:23.273 --> 00:01:27.207
Toad didn't know how to wash a shirt.

21
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.556
He wasn't going to learn either.

22
00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:34.279
"I'll send him money," Toad thought.

23
00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:38.078
"I'll send enough to wash his shirts for a year!"

24
00:01:38.079 --> 00:01:42.875
A flagman at the station waved a flag.

25
00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:45.733
The engineer blew his whistle.

26
00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:50.611
The train sped away.

27
00:01:50.612 --> 00:01:54.012
Toad danced with delight.

28
00:01:54.013 --> 00:02:00.786
"Soon I'll be at Toad Hall!" Toad thought.

29
00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.291
The engineer leaned out the side.

30
00:02:04.292 --> 00:02:07.871
"I hear another train behind us!" he shouted.

31
00:02:07.872 --> 00:02:12.838
"It's chasing us, and it's coming fast!"
